# Session Handoff

When the user requests a session handoff (`handoff`, `create a handoff`, `prepare a session handoff`, or equivalent), use the `session-handoff` skill at `.cursor/skills/session-handoff/SKILL.md`.

The handoff MUST be produced as standalone Markdown that can be copied into a new AI session.
